              "segment": {
                "start_index": 1396,
                "end_index": 1583,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Instead of guessing randomly, a modern CPU or calculator uses a tiny **lookup table** (or a very basic polynomial approximation like a Chebyshev polynomial) stored in its physical silicon"
